Grand Dragon Leviathan was once a favoured Titan of [[Lord Casterwill]]. After his death, no [[Seeker]] was ever able to control the Titan again. {{Source|Grand Dragon Leviathan (comic)}} 

Grand Dragon Leviathan rose from the canals of [[Venice, Italy]], and fought the Huntik team along with [[Ignatius]], [[Icarus]], [[Kipperin]] and [[King Basilisk]]. {{Source|The Curse of Venice}}

[[Sophie Casterwill]] used it to dive down deep underwater with the Huntik team. {{Source|Mission to Skara Brae}}
